        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Ezhou, Quzhou, Kaihua County, Hubei Province, Zhejiang Province, China, Annam\n- People: Trần Ích Tắc\n- Organizations: Yuan Dynasty\n- Roles: prefecture-level city, county, King of Annam\n\nFacts:\n- Ezhou is a prefecture-level city in eastern Hubei Province, China.\n- Quzhou is a prefecture-level city in western Zhejiang Province, People's Republic of China.\n- Kaihua County is a county under the jurisdiction of Quzhou city in Zhejiang Province, People's Republic of China.\n- After another failed attempt by the Yuan Dynasty to restore Trần Ích Tắc as King of Annam, Trần Ích Tắc continued to live in Ezhou, Hubei, and died on foreign soil.",
